{"sym":"FCX","v":2,"about":{"summary":"Freeport-McMoRan Inc. engages in the mining of mineral properties in North America, South America, and Indonesia. The company primarily explores for copper, gold, molybdenum, silver, and other metals. Its assets include the Grasberg minerals district in Indonesia; Morenci, Bagdad, Safford, Sierrita, and Miami in Arizona; Chino and Tyrone in New Mexico; and Henderson and Climax in Colorado, North America, as well as Cerro Verde in Peru and El Abra in Chile. The company was formerly known as Freeport-McMoRan Copper & Gold Inc. and changed its name to Freeport-McMoRan Inc. in July 2014. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona.","lead":"Freeport-McMoRan Inc. engages in the mining of mineral properties in North America, South America, and Indonesia. The company primarily explores for copper, gold, molybdenum, silver, and other metals.","web":"https://fcx.com","ir":"http://www.fcx.com/ir/index.htm","emp":29000,"city":"Phoenix","state":"AZ","country":"United States"},"officers":[{"n":"Ms. Kathleen Lynne Quirk","t":"CEO, President & Director","age":61,"yb":1964,"pay":3007500,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Maree E. Robertson","t":"Executive VP & CFO","age":49,"yb":1976,"pay":1690100,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Stephen T. Higgins","t":"Executive VP & Chief Administrative Officer","age":67,"yb":1958,"pay":1429600,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Douglas N. Currault II","t":"Executive VP & General Counsel","age":60,"yb":1965,"pay":1301300,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Ellie L. Mikes","t":"VP & Chief Accounting Officer","age":47,"yb":1978,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Bertrand L. Odinet II","t":"Senior VP, Chief Information Officer & Chief Innovation Officer","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. David Joint","t":"Vice President of Investor Relations","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Pamela Q. Masson","t":"Senior VP & Chief Human Resources Officer,","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. W. Russell King","t":"Senior Vice President of International Relations & Federal Government Affairs","age":75